<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco reiterated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco reiterated as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it reiterated a buy rating on Cisco Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- said Cisco's fourth quarter proforma earnings of $0.55 a share fell below the so-called &quot;whisper numbers&quot; of up to $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- said remains optimistic about the &quot;tone of business&quot; and sees a buying opportunity in any weakness related to missing the whisper numbers.</p>
</text>
